  "solution": "**Given: **\n\n5.01 + (3.01 × 1.99²) × 4 + 6.01 ÷ 2.03 \n\n**Concept : **\n\nBODMAS\n\n**Calculations: **\n\n5.01 + (3.01 × 1.99²) × 4 + (6.01 ÷ 2.03)\n\n= 5.01 + (11.92) × 4 + 2.96\n\n=5.01 + 2.96 + 11.92 × 4\n\n= 5.01 + 2.96 + 47.68\n\n= 55.64 ~ 56\n\n**Hence, the answer is 56.**",
